{"id":"wb-7-1742","name":"王稼祥故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"王稼祥故居","text":"王稼祥故居是中国共产党高层领导人王稼祥的出生地，位于安徽省泾县桃花潭镇厚岸村。故居建于清末，坐东朝西。王稼祥1906年8月15日出生于此，1913年至1918年在此居住期间完成小学教育。故居于2013年被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8E%8B%E7%A8%BC%E7%A5%A5%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":93355137,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93355137","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8f3f8353ed1df79f7fd29dcd.jpg","title":"Jingxian_Hou'an_2017.08.19_10-54-47.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jingxian_Hou%27an_2017.08.19_10-54-47.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/Jingxian_Hou%27an_2017.08.19_10-54-47.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"泾县厚岸王稼祥故居","width":320,"height":180}}